			"notes": "## What's Changed\n- Readded Vanilla Trades (enable with built in datapack)\n- Cloth Config is no longer included\n- ThonkUtil has been updated to 1.2.1 which has support for 1.17 and 1.18\n- Updated Spawning Logic to be more in parity of the original\n- Remade Configs (existing configs will break)\n- Added bundle trade type\n- Added potion trade type (basic trade will still support potions so old datapacks don't break)\n- Added container trade type (supports shulker boxes bundles? chests?)\n- supports 1.17 and 1.18 now\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/3e2j/goblin-traders-fabric/compare/1.3.0-1.17...1.4.0-1.17-BETA-1"
